      "body": "Maybe stick with a single option 'sp_info' or something, which would be the list of sp addresses of each output, or an empty list for regular transactions?\nThat way, caller is aware that he has to think about sp payments, and it feels less aggressive than forcing 99% of the use cases to set force=true everytime?",
