      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "It is tricky problem, I wonder what are the other wallets doing for this issue. How are Sparrow and others addressing this issue?\n\nIf we go with the main idea proposed by this issue, probably the mandatory signal of that extra parameter could be limited to transactions with P2TR outputs.\nWe should probably add also some way to export-import SP information between wallets, some export/import `address book` between wallets which I guess would require a BIP in order to standardize it between wallets..",
